{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Interviewcollectie Stichting Mondelinge Geschiedenis Indonesië, interview 1526"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:50909"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Resp_Interviewnummer 1526.1"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Resp_Interviewnummer 1526.2"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Mondelinge Geschiedenis Indonesië (SMGI)"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Koninklijk Instituut voor Taal-, Land- en Volkenkunde (KITLV)"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"KITLV  Archives"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"KITLV \/ Leiden Universiteit UB"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Dit interview bestaat uit twee gesprekken: 1526.1 en 1526.2.<\/p><p>1526.1 De geïnterviewde ging in 1937 naar Indië. Hij werkte daar voor een cultuurmaatschappij en was van 1941 tot 1947 militair bij het KNIL. De geïnterviewde werd krijgsgevangene gemaakt en verbleef onder andere in Thailand. Na de bevrijding kwam de geïnterviewde weer in dienst eerst in Bali en vervolgens in Zuid-Sumatra. Hierna vervolgde hij zijn werk bij de cultuurmaatschappij.<\/p><p>1526.2 De geïnterviewde vertelt over zijn werk voor de cultuurmaatschappij. Hij deed administratief werk. Hij beschrijft de invloed van de politionele acties en de soevereiniteitsoverdracht op de bedrijfsvoering. De geïnterviewde vertelt tot slot over de nationalisatie van het bedrijf en gaat in op zijn vertrek in 1958.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2012-08-03"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"dekolonisatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"oral history"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"koloniale samenleving"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Japanse bezetting"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Japanse capitulatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Bersiap"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"interneringskampen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"KNIL"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nederlands Indië"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Indonesische onafhankelijkheid"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"cultuurmaatschappij"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"nationalisatie"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2000-02-07"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Fridus Steijlen (coördinator)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2011-08-24"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2012-08-03"},{"typeName":"series","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"seriesInformation":{"typeName":"seriesInformation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Deze dataset bevat de metadata van de interviewcollectie Stichting Mondelinge Geschiedenis Indonesië.<br>Een groep wetenschappers uit verschillende disciplines nam in 1994 het initiatief om de verhalen en ervaringen van mensen, die de turbulente laatkoloniale en vroeg-postkoloniale tijd tussen 1940-1962 in Nederlands-Indië, Indonesië of Nieuw-Guinea hadden meegemaakt, vast te leggen nu het nog kon. Men koos ervoor om geen onderzoeksproject op te zetten, maar om zich te concentreren op het verzamelen van de verhalen van mensen vanuit archiveringsoogpunt als basis voor toekomstig onderzoek. Tussen 1997 en 2001 zijn er 1190 interviews met 724 mensen opgenomen, in totaal 2800 uur aan geluidsmateriaal.<\/p><p>Een overzicht van het project en de interviews in EASY vindt u onder 'Data files'.<\/p><p>De interviews worden bij DANS duurzaam bewaard, maar worden (voorlopig) door het KITLV zelf ontsloten. Zie het veld 'Relations' voor een link naar de collectie op de KITLV-website.<\/p>"}}]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Unknown"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D30000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D60000"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D30000","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Geesteswetenschappen"},{"lang":"en","value":"Humanities"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34000","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Geschiedenis"},{"lang":"en","value":"History"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D60000","termName":[{"lang":"en","value":"Social sciences"},{"lang":"nl","value":"Sociale wetenschappen"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"}]},{"typeName":"dansCollection","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cf8c960a-aa0f-4ee3-a7b0-4a3c847669e6","https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cfa04ed6-4cd0-4651-80cb-ed4ca8fa14f3"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cf8c960a-aa0f-4ee3-a7b0-4a3c847669e6","vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections"},{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cfa04ed6-4cd0-4651-80cb-ed4ca8fa14f3","vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections"}]},{"typeName":"dansRelation","multiple":true,"typeClas